  "worked_solution": "The matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T$ is $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}].$ \n\nComputing the determinant of $A,$ we get\n\n$$\ndet(A)=|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}|=2\\cdot (-1)-3\\cdot 1=-5.\n$$\n\nSo, the area scale factor of the transformation is\n\n$$\n|det(A)|=|-5|=5.\n$$",
